<title>GERMANY: TABLE-German June import prices fall 0.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>TABLE-German June import prices fall 0.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    June 97     May 97	June 96</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.2	 +0.5	 -0.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +3.3	 +2.8	 +0.2</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 100.6	100.8	 97.4</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.3	 +0.2	 -0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +1.5	 +1.1	 +0.2</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 105.2	104.9	103.6</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
